<script setup lang="ts">
import {ref,computed,watch} from 'vue';import GeneAtlas from './GeneAtlas.vue';const props=defineProps<{pattern:any}>();const emit=defineEmits(['create']);const step=ref(0),active=ref(0);const steps=[['观其形','从完整纹样走近细节'],['拆其骨','图元与构图各司其职'],['读其意','寓意需要证据相连'],['入其器','材料给设计以边界']];const visual=computed(()=>props.pattern.genes.filter((g:any)=>g.type==='图元'));const current=computed(()=>visual.value[active.value]);function inspectGene(g:any){active.value=Math.max(0,visual.value.findIndex((x:any)=>x.code===g.code));step.value=1}
const canCreate=computed(()=>visual.value.some((g:any)=>g.status==='已确认'&&g.assets?.some((a:any)=>a.svg)));
const caption=computed(()=>props.pattern.text.split('\n').filter((x:string)=>/^图\d/.test(x)));const source=computed(()=>caption.value.join('；')||props.pattern.document);watch(()=>props.pattern.id,()=>{step.value=0;active.value=0});
</script><template><section class="pattern-reading"><div class="reading-progress"><button v-for="(s,i) in steps" :class="{active:step===i}" @click="step=i"><small>0{{i+1}}</small><span>{{s[0]}}<em>{{s[1]}}</em></span></button></div><div v-if="step===0" class="reading-stage"><div class="reading-original"><div class="arch-frame"><img :src="pattern.images.find((a:any)=>!a.code)?.url||pattern.images[0]?.url" :alt="pattern.name"></div><span class="image-caption">原纹样 · 保留文档原图</span></div><div class="reading-prose"><p class="kicker">一纹一档 / {{pattern.id}}</p><h2>{{pattern.name}}</h2><p>纹样结构与寓意</p><div class="meaning-cloud"><span v-for="i in pattern.imagery.filter((i:any)=>i.category==='文化意象')">{{i.word}}<small>{{i.status}}</small></span></div><blockquote>{{source}}</blockquote><button class="link-action" @click="step=1">继续拆解这枚纹样 →</button></div></div><div v-else-if="step===1" class="reading-stage"><div class="anatomy-display"><div class="anatomy-orbit"></div><div class="anatomy-img"><img v-if="current?.assets[0]" :src="current.assets[0].url" :alt="current.name"><p v-else>这条图元保留了文字记录，尚无独立图像。</p></div><span class="anatomy-label">{{current?.code}} <b>{{current?.name}}</b></span><div class="anatomy-selector"><button v-for="(g,i) in visual" :class="{active:active===i}" @click="active=Number(i)"><img v-if="g.assets[0]" :src="g.assets[0].url" :alt="g.name"></button></div></div><div class="reading-prose"><p class="kicker">PATTERN ANATOMY / 独立图元观察</p><h2>花有形，纹有骨。</h2><p>{{current?.structure}}</p><p class="muted">原文位置：{{current?.position}} · {{current?.status}}</p><div class="composition-notes"><article v-for="g in pattern.genes.filter((g:any)=>g.type==='构图')"><span>构图</span><h4>{{g.name.replace(/〔.*?〕/g,'')}}</h4><p>{{g.structure}}</p></article></div><button class="link-action" @click="step=2">这些结构，为什么有这样的寓意？ →</button></div></div><GeneAtlas v-else-if="step===2" :pattern="pattern" @gene="inspectGene"/><div v-else class="reading-stage"><div class="craft-diagram"><div class="craft-rings"><span>纹</span><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><p>从文化识别，到结构简化，再到器面适配。</p><div class="craft-diagram-labels"><span>线条连续</span><span>节点加固</span><span>层次有度</span></div></div><div class="reading-prose"><p class="kicker">FROM PATTERN TO OBJECT / 纹样入器</p><h2>能被看见，也要能被制作。</h2><article v-for="g in pattern.genes.filter((g:any)=>g.type==='工艺适配')" class="craft-advice"><h4>{{g.name.replace(/〔.*?〕/g,'')}}</h4><p>{{g.structure}}</p></article><p v-if="!pattern.genes.some((g:any)=>g.type==='工艺适配')">该样本已提取核心图元与构图基因，进入造物台后将由 Shapely DFM 引擎自动匹配器面尺寸与锡镶浅浮雕参数。</p><p class="muted">系统已内置毫米级 DFM 工艺校验与 1:1 R2010 DXF 工程包输出，直连威海非遗传承人工坊制版。</p><button v-if="canCreate" class="primary" @click="emit('create',pattern.id)">带着理解，开始造物 ↗</button><p v-else class="muted">这份档案保留原图供阅读，暂无可用于组合的独立轮廓。可到纹样库选择其他图元开始造物。</p></div></div></section></template>
